WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.916 --> 00:00:04.833
Ah, was that great?

2
00:00:13.625 --> 00:00:14.666
Squishy?

3
00:00:15.541 --> 00:00:16.666
You feel good?

4
00:00:19.958 --> 00:00:24.833
♪ Squishy and me Nuzzling cheeks ♪

5
00:00:24.916 --> 00:00:28.958
♪ Best of friends forever We're so happy ♪

6
00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:33.916
♪ I promise I'll never leave Squishy ♪

7
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.750
♪ Sweet little Squishy Here's my song for you ♪

8
00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:41.958
♪ My sweet Squishy That’s you ♪

9
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.958
Wow, Bonnie. That's a really nice song.

10
00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:46.958
I just made it up.

11
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.458
I call it "Squishy's Song."

12
00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:54.291
On their way to Snowbelle City,

13
00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:56.958
the site of Ash's eighth gym battle challenge,

14
00:00:57.208 --> 00:00:59.958
our heroes are being watched from the shadows.

15
00:01:08.083 --> 00:01:09.125
Headquarters.

16
00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:10.958
Put us through to the boss.

17
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.291
Hold on.

18
00:01:15.166 --> 00:01:17.083
Giovanni, sir!

19
00:01:17.958 --> 00:01:19.916
Oh, it's you. Is something wrong?

20
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.958
Sir, there's something you need to know of the utmost importance.

21
00:01:24.375 --> 00:01:28.500
That's right. There's an evil organization that stands in Team Rocket's way

22
00:01:28.583 --> 00:01:31.500
of conquering the world. They're located here in Kalos.

23
00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:32.958
Yeah.

24
00:01:33.958 --> 00:01:35.291
Have you seen them?

25
00:01:35.375 --> 00:01:36.458
Yes!

26
00:01:36.541 --> 00:01:37.916
And they think they're so cool

27
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.583
with their red outfits and their fashion eyewear.

28
00:01:40.958 --> 00:01:44.666
- So, they are real.
- You know about them?

29
00:01:45.416 --> 00:01:49.041
Heh. All right then. Stay right there in Kalos.

30
00:01:49.125 --> 00:01:51.583
Find out this organization's intentions.

31
00:01:51.666 --> 00:01:52.833
Will do, sir!

32
00:01:53.166 --> 00:01:55.666
There's something else we think you should know.

33
00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:58.541
They're after a certain kind of Pokémon which is brand-new.

34
00:01:59.375 --> 00:02:00.375
Brand new?

35
00:02:00.458 --> 00:02:02.458
I've got pictures. Hold on.

36
00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:08.125
It is able to combine with certain cells and transform freely.

37
00:02:08.208 --> 00:02:10.583
I've never seen a Pokémon like it!

38
00:02:12.958 --> 00:02:14.208
Then catch it.

39
00:02:14.708 --> 00:02:16.958
You must catch it before they do.

40
00:02:17.041 --> 00:02:17.958
Sir!

41
00:02:18.958 --> 00:02:21.208
Good. I'm counting on you.

42
00:02:23.375 --> 00:02:25.000
So, he's counting on us.

43
00:02:25.291 --> 00:02:26.875
He loves us.

44
00:02:27.958 --> 00:02:30.833
So much has happened during our time in Kalos.

45
00:02:31.458 --> 00:02:33.833
Looking back, the challenging days.

46
00:02:34.125 --> 00:02:36.833
So true, however, what must we do?

47
00:02:36.916 --> 00:02:39.833
Stop the glasses gang in their arrogant tracks!

48
00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:42.916
Then back to headquarters for a slap on the back!

49
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.875
But what about those twerps and Pikachu, too?

50
00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:48.458
First things first. We do what we must do.

51
00:02:48.958 --> 00:02:50.166
Then it's settled!

52
00:02:50.666 --> 00:02:52.583
And a-searching we will go!

53
00:02:52.666 --> 00:02:54.250
Glasses gang, ho!

54
00:02:54.708 --> 00:02:56.458
Wobbuffet.

55
00:02:56.541 --> 00:02:58.416
We're out of here, yo!

56
00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:01.833
So, it's all for the boss, you know!

57
00:03:49.958 --> 00:03:52.958
Hey, Squishy, Pancham and Chespin wanna play.

58
00:04:07.958 --> 00:04:10.500
I think Squishy would rather take a nap now.

59
00:04:21.333 --> 00:04:23.166
What is this? What's happening?

60
00:04:32.708 --> 00:04:34.958
Respond! Respond!

61
00:04:38.125 --> 00:04:39.000
Squishy?

62
00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:42.583
What's the matter?

63
00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:45.666
I think that you're feeling sad.

64
00:04:49.708 --> 00:04:53.291
♪ I always know what you're feeling ♪

65
00:04:53.375 --> 00:04:57.041
♪ And I'll always be there to catch you ♪

66
00:04:57.125 --> 00:05:01.208
♪ I'll care for you And always be with you ♪

67
00:05:01.291 --> 00:05:04.958
♪ To me, Squishy Your feelings are so real ♪

68
00:05:05.458 --> 00:05:07.708
♪ I'll never leave Squishy ♪

69
00:05:07.791 --> 00:05:09.500
♪ My sweet Squishy That's you ♪

70
00:05:14.958 --> 00:05:17.000
I hope you're safe.

71
00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.333
Weavile.

72
00:05:26.666 --> 00:05:28.458
Weavile, excellent work.

73
00:05:28.541 --> 00:05:30.958
And my Druddigon did well, too, you know.

74
00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.958
Z2, you're coming with us.

75
00:05:45.958 --> 00:05:46.958
This is Mable.

76
00:05:47.166 --> 00:05:49.833
Doctor, the beam is very effective.

77
00:05:50.375 --> 00:05:53.750
Z2 can no longer camouflage itself.

78
00:05:54.291 --> 00:05:57.875
Of course. The beam's my invention, after all.

79
00:05:57.958 --> 00:06:01.916
Mega Evolution energy is proving how useful it is once again.

80
00:06:02.291 --> 00:06:03.166
Mm-hm.

81
00:06:05.166 --> 00:06:07.041
All right, time to go.

82
00:06:10.333 --> 00:06:11.125
All right. Slash!

83
00:06:17.958 --> 00:06:19.333
Weavile, let's go!

84
00:06:45.833 --> 00:06:47.916
- Aah!
- It's like Bryony told us.

85
00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.166
Ah, look at that.

86
00:06:59.916 --> 00:07:00.791
Do it!

87
00:07:08.541 --> 00:07:10.125
Use dragon pulse!

88
00:07:16.416 --> 00:07:17.541
Use metal claw!

89
00:07:24.208 --> 00:07:25.291
Everyone, fire!

90
00:07:42.958 --> 00:07:44.916
Oh! What do you think you're doing?

91
00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:48.750
This is our chance to catch it while the beam is still affecting it.

92
00:07:49.291 --> 00:07:50.125
Understood.

93
00:07:58.833 --> 00:07:59.958
Hey, any luck?

94
00:08:00.625 --> 00:08:03.875
That arrogant eyewear gang is nowhere to be found.

95
00:08:03.958 --> 00:08:07.208
And when we don't want to see them, they're in our faces.

96
00:08:09.375 --> 00:08:10.583
Squishy?

97
00:08:11.458 --> 00:08:14.958
Its markings are different. Perhaps a Squishy of a different color?

98
00:08:15.958 --> 00:08:19.041
- Then that means...
- Perhaps there's more than one Squishy.

99
00:08:19.125 --> 00:08:20.916
Wow, stop the presses.

100
00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.125
What luck!

101
00:08:22.208 --> 00:08:25.375
And how. We've struck Squishy gold!

102
00:08:27.791 --> 00:08:28.916
No, you don't.

103
00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:29.916
Just relax.

104
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.583
You're ours now.

105
00:08:31.958 --> 00:08:34.541
I should say, you now belong to the boss.

106
00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.958
Weavile.

107
00:08:45.208 --> 00:08:47.166
You lugs! What was that for?

108
00:08:47.583 --> 00:08:48.708
What do you know?

109
00:08:48.791 --> 00:08:50.416
The glasses gang returns.

110
00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.416
Here we go. Who are you?

111
00:08:52.958 --> 00:08:57.833
- Prepare for trouble. Here we go, indeed.
- And make it double, as you recede.

112
00:08:58.125 --> 00:09:00.416
To protect the world from devastation.

113
00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.958
To unite all people within our nation.

114
00:09:03.041 --> 00:09:07.916
- Those gaudy glasses are a complete waste.
- The one thing you lack is taste.

115
00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.458
It's Jessie!

116
00:09:09.541 --> 00:09:11.375
And it's James!

117
00:09:11.916 --> 00:09:15.000
Team Rocket blasts off with clear 20/20 vision.

118
00:09:15.125 --> 00:09:18.208
Surrendering now would be a most prudent decision!

119
00:09:18.291 --> 00:09:19.958
Meowth, with precision!

120
00:09:20.958 --> 00:09:23.125
Thanks a lot. Nice to meet you.

121
00:09:24.208 --> 00:09:29.500
- I'll wager Bryony was talking about them.
- Time to stop this childish nonsense.

122
00:09:33.541 --> 00:09:37.541
- We're the real grown-ups here!
- We're up for a big job promotion!

123
00:09:37.958 --> 00:09:38.958
Oh, real mature.

124
00:09:39.458 --> 00:09:41.208
Inkay, destroy that ray!

125
00:09:41.625 --> 00:09:42.666
Psybeam, touché!

126
00:09:45.666 --> 00:09:47.000
Druddigon, let's go!

127
00:09:48.583 --> 00:09:50.500
- Arg!
- Use metal claw!

128
00:09:50.583 --> 00:09:51.958
Weavile!

129
00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:54.958
All right, Gourgeist, use seed bomb!

130
00:10:05.625 --> 00:10:08.083
There's something wrong with those wackos.

131
00:10:08.666 --> 00:10:09.875
- Go.
- Right.

132
00:10:11.791 --> 00:10:12.875
I'm so sorry.

133
00:10:12.958 --> 00:10:16.791
An unexpected problem kept us from capturing Z2.

134
00:10:16.916 --> 00:10:18.458
Not acceptable!

135
00:10:19.416 --> 00:10:22.333
Isn't there anyone nearby who can help them out?

136
00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:23.666
Hold on.

137
00:10:24.625 --> 00:10:26.833
Hmm. Wait. Just one moment.

138
00:10:27.125 --> 00:10:30.916
There is someone, but this person is your...

139
00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:32.958
Who's that Pokémon?

140
00:10:38.416 --> 00:10:40.083
It's Persian!

141
00:10:50.333 --> 00:10:52.000
Unh. I can't run.

142
00:10:52.083 --> 00:10:54.583
Even my stomach cramps have cramps!

143
00:10:54.666 --> 00:10:56.458
Let's take a cab next time.

144
00:10:58.208 --> 00:10:59.625
Of course you're fine.

145
00:10:59.708 --> 00:11:02.000
All you do is float. Makes it easy to gloat!

146
00:11:04.958 --> 00:11:06.833
Maybe it's cramping as well.

147
00:11:06.958 --> 00:11:08.458
Cramping? Really?

148
00:11:08.625 --> 00:11:13.000
That reminds me, the twerps' Squishy likes to lounge around in the sun.

149
00:11:13.083 --> 00:11:15.875
Yeah, sunlight's the way it gets its energy.

150
00:11:16.541 --> 00:11:17.916
Time for some tanning.

151
00:11:19.958 --> 00:11:22.125
There. That looks like a good spot.

152
00:11:22.208 --> 00:11:23.208
On my way.

153
00:11:27.416 --> 00:11:28.750
How does that feel?

154
00:11:38.416 --> 00:11:40.625
Success. You're green with health!

155
00:11:40.708 --> 00:11:42.750
Perfect! Off we go!

156
00:11:42.958 --> 00:11:47.583
- Let's report our success to the boss!
- Then sit back and soak in the praise!

157
00:11:48.916 --> 00:11:50.875
An ice beam? But how?

158
00:11:50.958 --> 00:11:52.500
Get this cube off of me!

159
00:11:53.958 --> 00:11:55.208
Well, that was easy.

160
00:11:57.958 --> 00:11:59.958
You're not getting away this time.

161
00:12:01.333 --> 00:12:02.500
Arg. Huh?

162
00:12:06.041 --> 00:12:07.875
Persistent jerks, aren't they?

163
00:12:08.583 --> 00:12:10.250
We'll deal with you and your glasses

164
00:12:10.333 --> 00:12:12.541
after we deliver this to headquarters.

165
00:12:13.083 --> 00:12:16.250
Sorry. Our headquarters gets the delivery.

166
00:12:16.791 --> 00:12:18.750
Weavile! Metal Claw!

167
00:12:19.791 --> 00:12:21.500
Running is job one!

168
00:12:32.333 --> 00:12:36.333
Give it up and hand it over. Playing tag is pointless and boring.

169
00:12:36.416 --> 00:12:39.958
Not on your life! You and your annoying glasses.

170
00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:41.291
Dragon pulse, go!

171
00:12:52.416 --> 00:12:53.958
Wobbuffet rules!

172
00:12:54.291 --> 00:12:56.333
Wobbu!

173
00:13:01.958 --> 00:13:03.708
Use icy wind!

174
00:13:20.541 --> 00:13:21.958
Prepare for retrieval.

175
00:13:23.875 --> 00:13:24.875
Not today!

176
00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:27.208
Gourgeist, dark pulse!

177
00:13:28.666 --> 00:13:29.583
Use metal claw!

178
00:13:36.416 --> 00:13:38.208
Okay, Inkay! Psybeam, now!

179
00:13:39.708 --> 00:13:40.958
Druddigon, slash!

180
00:13:48.333 --> 00:13:50.083
Gourgeist, leech seed, let's go!

181
00:13:57.958 --> 00:14:00.666
What a complete pain. Weavile, metal claw!

182
00:14:04.041 --> 00:14:05.583
Everybody attack now.

183
00:14:12.375 --> 00:14:13.166
Gourgeist!

184
00:14:15.125 --> 00:14:16.583
Quick, Inkay, return!

185
00:14:16.666 --> 00:14:17.458
And you, too.

186
00:14:17.541 --> 00:14:18.875
Whoa, strong!

187
00:14:18.958 --> 00:14:20.750
Wobbuffet.

188
00:14:25.666 --> 00:14:27.166
Now let's wrap this up.

189
00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:28.041
Right.

190
00:14:48.208 --> 00:14:49.000
Uh-oh.

191
00:15:08.541 --> 00:15:09.625
Squishy, what's wrong?

192
00:15:10.416 --> 00:15:11.750
It got big!

193
00:15:12.041 --> 00:15:13.750
What is that thing?

194
00:15:14.541 --> 00:15:15.666
Oh, boy.

195
00:15:15.791 --> 00:15:17.041
It's really mad.

196
00:15:42.333 --> 00:15:43.166
That power.

197
00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:44.958
It's the real deal.

198
00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:48.250
This is not going to end the same as it did in Terminus Cave.

199
00:15:48.958 --> 00:15:52.958
- Man, that packs a punch.
- None of this is making sense anymore.

200
00:15:58.833 --> 00:16:00.458
Oh, no. Not again.

201
00:16:05.083 --> 00:16:07.166
Just in the nick of time.

202
00:16:10.291 --> 00:16:11.916
I've seen that Charizard.

203
00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:12.958
That's our target?

204
00:16:13.541 --> 00:16:14.583
And you are...?

205
00:16:15.583 --> 00:16:17.958
Listen, I'll buy you some time. Be ready.

206
00:16:22.041 --> 00:16:24.541
Now, Charizard, use dragon claw!

207
00:16:24.625 --> 00:16:26.083
Uh-oh. It's that guy!

208
00:16:33.041 --> 00:16:35.291
Respond to my heart, Key Stone.

209
00:16:35.375 --> 00:16:39.291
Beyond Evolution. Mega Evolve!

210
00:16:45.958 --> 00:16:47.166
All right! Get it!

211
00:16:49.958 --> 00:16:51.916
We can't let them beat us to the draw.

212
00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.333
Let's shut them down.

213
00:16:53.416 --> 00:16:55.083
All right, team, let's go!

214
00:16:58.291 --> 00:16:59.916
Quick. Block its attack.

215
00:17:17.208 --> 00:17:18.500
Dragon claw!

216
00:17:28.291 --> 00:17:29.958
- It's that light!
- Huh?

217
00:17:43.333 --> 00:17:46.250
Hmm. Guess it won't be as easy to defeat as I hoped.

218
00:17:57.458 --> 00:17:58.916
Full power now!

219
00:18:21.708 --> 00:18:22.916
End of the line.

220
00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:24.208
No!

221
00:18:24.291 --> 00:18:26.250
That little tyke belongs to us!

222
00:18:26.333 --> 00:18:27.916
So, keep your paws off!

223
00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.625
Wobbuffet!

224
00:18:32.541 --> 00:18:35.333
We're blasting off again!

225
00:18:35.416 --> 00:18:36.833
Wobbuffet!

226
00:18:42.958 --> 00:18:44.791
All right. Z2 is ours.

227
00:18:44.875 --> 00:18:46.833
Yes! We finally succeeded!

228
00:18:50.541 --> 00:18:51.958
Good job, Charizard.

229
00:18:53.041 --> 00:18:57.208
Alain, right? Thanks to you, we completed our mission successfully.

230
00:18:57.291 --> 00:18:58.250
Why the help?

231
00:18:58.458 --> 00:19:01.291
You answer to Lysandre and Lysandre alone!

232
00:19:01.375 --> 00:19:03.125
He gave me a direct order.

233
00:19:03.208 --> 00:19:05.083
And that was to catch Z2.

234
00:19:07.958 --> 00:19:10.333
I see. You encountered them.

235
00:19:10.416 --> 00:19:11.625
And not only that--

236
00:19:11.708 --> 00:19:14.291
We also confirmed that new species transforms

237
00:19:14.375 --> 00:19:16.958
into an incredibly powerful Pokémon.

238
00:19:17.833 --> 00:19:20.291
It'll be a great asset for Team Rocket.

239
00:19:21.083 --> 00:19:23.750
- Well, keep it up. Good work.
- Sir!

240
00:19:25.791 --> 00:19:29.375
We're going to be busy. Especially with that Charizard.

241
00:19:29.458 --> 00:19:31.416
Busy is as busy does.

242
00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.916
It's all for one, and one for all.

243
00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:35.958
Down with goofy glasses!

244
00:19:39.833 --> 00:19:41.250
Wobbuffet.

245
00:19:41.958 --> 00:19:43.583
Respond! Respond!

246
00:19:43.958 --> 00:19:46.041
Respond! Respond!

247
00:19:49.458 --> 00:19:50.250
Squishy?

248
00:19:50.333 --> 00:19:51.958
Hey, Bonnie, let's go.

249
00:19:53.041 --> 00:19:54.916
Something's wrong with Squishy.

250
00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.000
Even though it spent so much time lounging around in the sun?

251
00:19:58.083 --> 00:20:00.916
Yeah, I think Squishy's worried about something.

252
00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:01.958
Worried?

253
00:20:02.833 --> 00:20:06.666
Maybe you should hold it. Squishy really likes when you do that.

254
00:20:06.958 --> 00:20:07.875
Mm-hm.

255
00:20:08.041 --> 00:20:10.958
- It'll feel better, I'm sure.
- Squishy?

256
00:20:12.166 --> 00:20:15.833
Everything will be okay. I'll be right here with you.

257
00:20:20.958 --> 00:20:24.000
As Team Flare continues to advance their operation,

258
00:20:24.291 --> 00:20:26.708
the wheels of fate have begun to turn,

259
00:20:26.958 --> 00:20:30.208
drawing the Kalos region ever closer to devastation...

260
00:20:40.958 --> 00:20:43.958
Zygarde. You belong to me.

261
00:20:45.958 --> 00:20:48.291
..as the journey continues.
